# Field Notes & Reflections — the private layer.
#
# This is not "files we forgot to commit". fnr/.private/ is its own PRIVATE repo
# — https://github.com/batmany13/about-me-private — cloned into this ignored path:
#
#     git clone https://github.com/batmany13/about-me-private.git fnr/.private
#
# It holds repos.json (which repos the weekly reads), scrub_policy.md (what may be
# published), and the unscrubbed drafts. A fresh clone of about-me starts without
# it; that is expected, and the fix is the clone above, never a reconstruction.
fnr/.private/
